# Web container runtime config (nginx serving the SPA; /config.js): /srv/iltiam/env/<staging|production>/web.env
# Runbook: docs/runbooks/04-secrets.md. Inventory, owners and rotation: docs/secrets.md.
#
# This template holds NO values. Each NAME= line is filled from the GitHub Environment variable of the same name by
# scripts/render-env.sh. Nothing here is secret: everything the web app receives is readable in any browser.
# The image checks these at start and writes /config.js and the content security policy (CSP) from them; a missing or
# malformed API_BASE_URL or IMAGE_ORIGINS stops the container (iltiam/iltiam-web#25, web/README.md).

# --- Runtime config ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# var, required: the API's origin, https://staging-api.iltiamcare.com or https://api.iltiamcare.com. Goes into /config.js and the CSP's connect-src.
API_BASE_URL=
# var, required: where photos and masks load from (the CSP's img-src), a list separated by commas or spaces: https://*.compat.objectstorage.me-riyadh-1.oci.customer-oci.com. Keep the wildcard: the CSP is public, and the storage namespace must stay out of it (Runbook 8).
IMAGE_ORIGINS=
# var, required: public Cloudflare Turnstile site key of this environment's widget. The image doesn't read it yet (iltiam/iltiam-web#28).
TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
